<h1 class="page-title">Sound Design</h1>
<p class="standfirst">Sound design, mostly for games, plus implementation and music.</p>

<p>I'm a sound designer for games, based in Melbourne. I make the sounds, and the systems that make them react: foley and creature sounds, interfaces, the Blueprints, scripts and FMOD events that tie it all to what the player is doing, and music that changes with the game. Most of this work comes from my time at RMIT, working with game and animation teams.</p>
<p>Games are my focus, but not the only thing I do: I've also designed sound for short films, like <a href="/sound-design/hubworld/">Hubworld</a> and GAMER, and for other multimedia work, from an installation to a film festival's intermission (see my <a href="/experience/#credits">credits</a>).</p>

